  "reasoning": "The defendants processed hazardous waste (废机油) into fuel oil without obtaining a dangerous waste operating permit, and they illegally disposed of the resulting hazardous waste (分馏废水 and 废渣) by direct discharge into a pit, causing serious environmental pollution. Under Article 338 of the Criminal Law, such conduct constitutes illegal handling of dangerous waste (including illegal processing/operation and illegal disposal). Therefore the applicable crimes are illegal disposal of dangerous waste and illegal operation/management of dangerous waste.",
